WEBVTT

01:30.500 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.500 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 18]

01:37.990 --> 01:42.070
[Entry Permit
for the Tribute Ink Selection]

01:41.100 --> 01:42.039
His Majesty

01:42.400 --> 01:44.920
has moved up the Tribute Ink selection.

01:45.870 --> 01:47.479
Looking across Huizhou,

01:48.280 --> 01:50.200
the Tian family is stuck in lawsuits,

01:50.200 --> 01:51.400
while the Chen family

01:52.479 --> 01:54.140
hasn't launched anything new

01:54.509 --> 01:56.310
except the Scholar Ink.

01:56.680 --> 01:58.759
Driven by stress, Lord Yan

01:59.400 --> 02:01.120
came to us and tried

02:01.560 --> 02:03.640
to reconcile us and Zhen.

02:04.430 --> 02:05.400
Today,

02:05.400 --> 02:07.280
we rejected his kindness.

02:09.150 --> 02:10.840
We should pay a visit to him

02:11.400 --> 02:12.190
someday

02:12.240 --> 02:13.800
and apologize in person.

02:13.960 --> 02:16.420
The problem is
how we express our apologies.

02:16.430 --> 02:18.310
Are we going to bring Li Zhen along?

02:18.310 --> 02:19.520
If so, before that happens,

02:19.520 --> 02:21.470
should we also hold
a grand ceremony

02:21.470 --> 02:22.840
to welcome the Eighth Branch back?

02:22.840 --> 02:23.960
Well said.

02:25.800 --> 02:28.329
Lord Yan obviously looks down
on the Li family

02:28.560 --> 02:30.890
and thinks everyone of us as incompetent.

02:31.150 --> 02:32.400
For insisting that we must attend

02:32.400 --> 02:34.360
the Tribute Ink selection with that girl,

02:34.360 --> 02:36.150
he's such a foolish eunuch.

02:36.910 --> 02:38.110
In my opinion, it is he

02:38.120 --> 02:40.680
who owes an apology
to the Sixth Uncle and the Third Brother.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.430
Enough.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.590
If this gets out,

02:43.840 --> 02:45.590
where will the Li family stand?

02:46.280 --> 02:47.870
You must refrain
from saying such words again.

02:47.870 --> 02:48.670
Do you hear me?

02:50.360 --> 02:51.560
Yes, Sister-in-law.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.490
As a matter of fact,

02:55.590 --> 02:56.990
Lord Yan took that action

02:57.120 --> 02:59.000
because he holds the Li family
in high regard.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.310
He holds us in high regard?

03:00.310 --> 03:03.310
Does that mean he has to attach
the Eighth Branch to us?

03:04.680 --> 03:05.610
Sister-in-law,

03:06.120 --> 03:08.030
you also think that we should
have Zhen back for the selection,

03:08.030 --> 03:08.710
don't you?

03:11.910 --> 03:13.840
Didn't Zhen already make it clear?

03:13.910 --> 03:15.310
She refuses to come back.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.710
As someone expelled from the clan,

03:17.710 --> 03:19.970
is she even entitled to refuse anything?

03:20.560 --> 03:21.490
Sister-in-law,

03:22.960 --> 03:24.000
do you mean

03:24.000 --> 03:25.520
that if Zhen agrees,

03:25.840 --> 03:27.800
we should admit her back into the clan?

03:27.800 --> 03:28.870
Is it what you're suggesting?

03:28.870 --> 03:29.630
Shut up!

03:31.079 --> 03:32.680
Are you out of your mind, huh?

03:38.870 --> 03:39.870
The Li family

03:40.560 --> 03:42.160
has declined to such a state.

03:43.120 --> 03:45.590
If there were full of talents
and excellent ink products

03:45.590 --> 03:46.710
like before,

03:47.280 --> 03:48.280
would Lord Yan

03:48.280 --> 03:50.430
have said those words today?

03:51.430 --> 03:52.870
Father, are you saying

03:53.030 --> 03:54.310
that even you don't think

03:54.310 --> 03:57.030
I'm able to create the new Yunsong Ink?

03:58.560 --> 04:00.800
None of you have faith in me, do you?

04:01.800 --> 04:04.680
Nobody in this family believes in me,
right?

04:04.680 --> 04:05.400
Jingdong!

04:05.710 --> 04:06.190
You...

04:06.190 --> 04:06.800
Father.

04:07.750 --> 04:08.520
Aunt Rujun.

04:09.430 --> 04:10.520
Over the past few months,

04:10.520 --> 04:13.080
Jingdong has spent days and nights
in the ink workshop.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.280
He would even sacrifice his soul

04:14.280 --> 04:16.230
to the new Yunsong Ink if it could help.

04:16.230 --> 04:17.390
I believe we will surely

04:17.390 --> 04:19.120
be granted the privilege
to produce the Tribute Ink

04:19.120 --> 04:21.850
if we send Jingdong's creation
to the selection.

04:22.720 --> 04:23.600
Halt!

04:26.390 --> 04:27.270
Sit down.

04:41.600 --> 04:42.630
This is my fault.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.370
This is all my fault.

04:49.310 --> 04:50.600
I fought Jinshui for nearly

04:50.600 --> 04:51.930
the entirety of my life.

04:54.560 --> 04:57.090
I also forced Jingdong
to compete with Jingqi

04:57.870 --> 04:58.920
and Jingfu

05:00.070 --> 05:01.160
when he was little.

05:02.190 --> 05:03.850
The Tribute Ink case years ago

05:04.680 --> 05:05.810
took Jingqi's life.

05:06.190 --> 05:07.120
Jingfu

05:07.430 --> 05:08.160
died outside

05:08.160 --> 05:10.360
and couldn't even be buried
in the ancestral grave.

05:10.360 --> 05:12.040
Jinshui was expelled from the clan.

05:12.040 --> 05:14.160
He even swore an oath

05:14.430 --> 05:15.890
to never make ink anymore.

05:16.560 --> 05:19.490
There's no one left
for me and my son to fight against.

05:21.080 --> 05:22.400
Given that,

05:22.430 --> 05:24.360
we've been tormenting each other.

05:26.870 --> 05:28.330
You, Jingdong, are always

05:29.390 --> 05:32.040
harboring resentment
and antagonizing others.

05:32.040 --> 05:33.240
As for your wife,

05:33.720 --> 05:35.320
she is cautious in every way,

05:35.560 --> 05:36.870
trying to protect and pamper you

05:36.870 --> 05:38.480
out of fear of more damage to your legs,

05:38.480 --> 05:40.409
which will break your heart again.

05:40.430 --> 05:41.750
And your son...

05:42.430 --> 05:44.430
Every day, he is busy doing
heaven knows what

05:44.430 --> 05:46.600
and never steps into the ink workshop.

05:47.560 --> 05:48.650
Look what has become

05:48.650 --> 05:50.510
of a perfectly fine young man.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.600
You're criticizing me.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.850
Then what about you?

06:01.270 --> 06:03.920
Apart from supervising production
in the ink workshop,

06:03.920 --> 06:06.450
have you ever made
one single piece of new ink?

06:07.000 --> 06:08.390
That aside, you even

06:09.270 --> 06:11.750
picked a terrible man

06:12.310 --> 06:14.920
for your daughter as her husband!

06:14.950 --> 06:16.850
Aren't you ashamed when you reprimand me?

06:16.850 --> 06:18.800
It's the father's fault
for not properly educating his son!

06:18.800 --> 06:19.630
Jingdong!

06:20.920 --> 06:22.680
You've gone way out of line.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.170
Quick, come with me.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.480
Old Madam,

06:26.560 --> 06:27.360
Sixth Master,

06:27.390 --> 06:29.430
something happened in the ink workshop!

06:29.430 --> 06:30.070
Old Madam,

06:30.070 --> 06:30.720
Sixth Master,

06:30.720 --> 06:32.240
Manager Shao is taking
a group of ink-makers

06:32.240 --> 06:35.040
to the ancestral hall
to petition for Miss Li Zhen.

06:55.159 --> 06:55.960
Sixth Master.

06:56.390 --> 06:57.270
Young Master.

07:00.360 --> 07:01.720
What are you lot up to?

07:02.000 --> 07:02.800
Sixth Master,

07:02.950 --> 07:04.010
glad that you came.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.190
Upon hearing about
the main family's discussion

07:06.190 --> 07:08.390
on whether to let Miss Li Zhen return
for the Tribute Ink selection,

07:08.390 --> 07:10.430
we decided to come and petition for her.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.230
Sixth Master,

07:11.240 --> 07:12.430
we wrongly blamed Miss Li Zhen

07:12.430 --> 07:13.950
for the previous ink recipe incident.

07:13.950 --> 07:15.510
We'd like to apologize to her in person.

07:15.510 --> 07:17.000
That's right, Sixth Master.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.480
The ancient lacquer-soot ink
recreated by Miss Li Zhen

07:18.480 --> 07:19.600
has become a top seller in Li Ink.

07:19.600 --> 07:22.040
And her creation of Fu Jin Ink
is deeply favored by Lord Yan.

07:22.040 --> 07:22.870
Plus, the medicinal ink

07:22.870 --> 07:24.920
is a legacy left by the Li ancestors.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.750
It's only reasonable
to enter these two types of ink

07:26.750 --> 07:28.000
into the Tribute Ink selection.

07:28.000 --> 07:29.240
If Miss Li Zhen returns,

07:29.240 --> 07:31.430
Li Ink will surely regain the privilege
to produce the Tribute Ink.

07:31.430 --> 07:32.360
-Sixth Master,
-Sixth Master,

07:32.360 --> 07:35.690
-please let Miss Li Zhen back.
-please let Miss Li Zhen back.

07:40.159 --> 07:42.950
So none of you believe
the Sixth Branch then?

07:45.430 --> 07:47.390
You don't think I, Li Jingdong, am

07:48.190 --> 07:51.240
competent for the Tribute Ink selection,
do you?

07:52.000 --> 07:53.070
Manager Shao.

07:54.510 --> 07:55.360
Young Master,

07:56.240 --> 07:57.570
I don't mean any of that.

07:57.950 --> 07:59.600
We just want what's the best for Li Ink.

07:59.600 --> 08:00.430
Jingdong,

08:01.870 --> 08:03.480
don't be rude to Manager Shao.

08:03.480 --> 08:04.070
Father,

08:05.040 --> 08:06.970
as the manager of the ink workshop,

08:07.600 --> 08:10.200
he's meddling
with the main family's affairs,

08:10.430 --> 08:11.390
and has gathered

08:11.480 --> 08:12.810
a large group of workers

08:13.260 --> 08:14.700
to petition for Li Zhen.

08:15.600 --> 08:17.680
Isn't he overstepping his boundaries?

08:17.680 --> 08:19.920
I'm only voicing what we all have
in our hearts.

08:19.920 --> 08:22.630
We're acting solely
in the best interests of the main family.

08:22.630 --> 08:23.630
What main family?

08:24.920 --> 08:25.980
The Eighth Branch?

08:26.920 --> 08:28.380
Is Li Zhen your master now?

08:30.120 --> 08:30.920
Sixth Master,

08:31.040 --> 08:32.440
please be the judge here.

08:32.840 --> 08:33.510
We are...

08:33.720 --> 08:35.510
doing this in good faith.

08:35.909 --> 08:38.169
The Tian family is troubled by lawsuits.

08:38.200 --> 08:41.000
The Chen family can't offer
a top-tier ink product as of now.

08:41.000 --> 08:41.750
This year,

08:41.750 --> 08:43.120
Li Ink stands

08:43.150 --> 08:44.910
the highest chance of winning.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.840
Please let Miss Li Zhen come back

08:46.840 --> 08:48.840
so as to reclaim
the authority over the Tribute Ink.

08:48.840 --> 08:51.640
-Reclaim the authority!
-Reclaim the authority!

08:53.080 --> 08:55.240
Listen up, all of you.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.600
Even without Li Zhen,

08:59.440 --> 09:00.510
I, Li Jingdong, am

09:00.510 --> 09:04.110
still able to regain the privilege
of producing the Tribute Ink.

09:04.240 --> 09:05.960
Now, go back to your work.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.000
Move!

09:46.270 --> 09:47.840
We in the Sixth Branch are

09:48.910 --> 09:51.110
incapable of sustaining the Li family.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.120
My son is incapable

09:55.080 --> 09:56.790
of managing Li Ink well.

09:59.390 --> 10:02.480
I, Li Jinhe, am woefully incompetent.

10:08.790 --> 10:09.920
I'm so incompetent.

10:50.270 --> 10:51.720
Father, stop hitting him!

10:51.720 --> 10:53.630
Or Jingfu will die!

10:53.960 --> 10:55.690
If you must hit someone, hit me!

11:02.500 --> 11:03.580
I volunteer...

11:04.750 --> 11:06.000
to be removed...

11:07.030 --> 11:08.490
from the family register.

11:23.670 --> 11:24.980
Please.

11:25.390 --> 11:28.320
Please save my father.

11:28.320 --> 11:29.960
Please come out here.

11:38.870 --> 11:39.720
Mother,

11:40.550 --> 11:43.720
just because our names
were removed from the family register,

11:43.720 --> 11:47.000
does that mean
we're no longer part of the Li family?

11:47.000 --> 11:48.360
From today on,

11:48.910 --> 11:50.240
forget about that home.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.440
This is our home now.

11:53.030 --> 11:54.090
Do you understand?

11:55.200 --> 11:55.960
Yes.

11:56.670 --> 11:57.550
I'll kill anyone

11:57.550 --> 11:58.750
who dares to touch us!

11:58.840 --> 12:00.360
The ritual is completed.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.030
Sister,

12:24.440 --> 12:25.510
did you ask me to come

12:25.510 --> 12:26.360
talk about

12:26.390 --> 12:27.920
the Tribute Ink selection?

12:29.840 --> 12:33.240
Li Zhen has declined Lord Yan's invitation
to the selection.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.770
This matter is now known

12:35.000 --> 12:36.550
to everyone in Huizhou.

12:37.240 --> 12:38.840
You are seeking cooperation

12:38.840 --> 12:39.910
with both Li Ink

12:39.910 --> 12:41.960
and the New Li Ink.

12:43.150 --> 12:45.600
Her absence from the Tribute Ink selection
will inevitably

12:45.600 --> 12:47.720
affect the military supplies procurement.

12:47.720 --> 12:49.450
You should try to persuade her.

13:05.030 --> 13:06.120
In recent years,

13:06.550 --> 13:08.360
ink-making talents in Huizhou
have dwindled.

13:08.360 --> 13:12.480
Other prefectures have been in charge
of the Tribute Ink production for years.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.510
For nearly a year,

13:14.150 --> 13:16.080
among all the new Hui Ink products,

13:16.120 --> 13:18.550
only the ancient lacquer-soot ink
and the Nine-Treasure Ink

13:18.550 --> 13:19.910
have stood out.

13:20.030 --> 13:21.270
And both of them

13:21.670 --> 13:23.870
are creations of Li Zhen.

13:24.960 --> 13:27.270
Given that, you should understand
the importance

13:27.270 --> 13:29.070
of her attending the selection.

13:33.550 --> 13:35.200
Sister, I understand that.

13:36.030 --> 13:37.120
However... it is I

13:37.390 --> 13:40.030
who has been taking care
of our ink business in Huizhou.

13:40.030 --> 13:41.670
Please don't worry, Sister.

13:42.790 --> 13:44.600
I'm not doubting your ability.

13:45.550 --> 13:47.550
The military supplies procurement

13:47.670 --> 13:49.360
is just too significant an issue.

13:49.360 --> 13:51.480
We are deeply indebted
to Marshal Qi and the general,

13:51.480 --> 13:53.630
so naturally this heavy responsibility
should be ours.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.510
No blunders

13:54.600 --> 13:56.130
are allowed in this matter.

14:00.960 --> 14:01.720
I know.

14:26.000 --> 14:28.120
"I wonder if things will remain

14:28.630 --> 14:30.270
the same after today."

14:34.890 --> 14:36.340
It's a doubt about

14:36.370 --> 14:38.570
whether joy will continue after today.

14:39.030 --> 14:39.830
What is it now?

14:40.240 --> 14:41.570
Something on your mind?

14:43.200 --> 14:45.510
The poet did an even better job
writing the last sentence:

14:45.510 --> 14:46.870
"Savor today's happiness while it lasts,

14:46.870 --> 14:49.330
as what tomorrow brings
is not our concern."

14:51.080 --> 14:52.510
It's truly difficult for ordinary people

14:52.510 --> 14:55.170
to reach the famous poet
Mr. Tao's state of mind.

14:56.440 --> 14:57.240
Look,

14:57.510 --> 14:59.150
the weather is lovely today.

14:59.440 --> 15:01.360
If you can't continue with the reading,

15:01.360 --> 15:03.840
why not take Mr. Tao's advice

15:05.870 --> 15:07.080
and have some tea

15:08.000 --> 15:09.550
and pastries,

15:09.910 --> 15:11.750
so as to savor today's joy while it lasts?

15:11.750 --> 15:13.410
Stop beating around the bush.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.640
Just say whatever on your mind.

15:18.630 --> 15:20.360
I'm not trying to say anything.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.860
I haven't visited the New Li Ink Workshop

15:23.870 --> 15:25.360
since the renovation was done.

15:25.360 --> 15:26.760
That's why I came see you.

15:30.870 --> 15:31.840
Don't you have

15:32.600 --> 15:34.030
anything else to say?

15:35.390 --> 15:36.150
No, nothing.

15:51.120 --> 15:51.920
You're right.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.320
The weather is so lovely

15:53.320 --> 15:54.360
today.

15:55.720 --> 15:57.200
Staying indoors to read

15:57.200 --> 15:59.330
would be a waste of beautiful scenery.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.390
Do you have time today?

16:02.390 --> 16:03.030
Yes.

16:03.910 --> 16:04.960
I'll take you somewhere then.

16:04.960 --> 16:05.690
Let's go now.

16:15.120 --> 16:15.840
Careful.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.360
Whenever I feel distraught,

16:24.030 --> 16:25.270
I would come here.

16:26.150 --> 16:27.240
Every time I'm at this place,

16:27.240 --> 16:28.640
I would feel much better.

16:30.150 --> 16:32.030
Mr. Dongtu is unattached
to the mundane world,

16:32.030 --> 16:33.080
while you, Zhen, are

16:33.080 --> 16:34.320
a lady of her word.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.680
I truly find you admirable.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.840
I'm so flattered, Master Qi.

16:38.840 --> 16:40.370
This is just the beginning.

16:41.000 --> 16:43.390
Realizing Mr. Dongtu's dream

16:43.550 --> 16:44.480
is by no means

16:44.510 --> 16:46.000
an overnight effort.

16:46.200 --> 16:46.840
Fine.

16:47.550 --> 16:48.610
Then from today on,

16:49.000 --> 16:50.120
count me in.

16:54.670 --> 16:55.510
I know you came

16:56.120 --> 16:57.270
meet me today just to talk me

16:57.270 --> 16:59.200
into attending the Tribute Ink selection.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.360
Over these few days,

17:00.870 --> 17:04.069
everyone thinks I should attend
the Tribute Ink selection.

17:04.069 --> 17:05.200
But they are unaware

17:05.680 --> 17:07.160
that the Tribute Ink

17:08.109 --> 17:09.589
is like a thorn in my side.

17:10.240 --> 17:11.720
Every time I think of it,

17:12.400 --> 17:13.750
all that comes to mind

17:15.160 --> 17:17.619
is the whipping
my father was punished with,

17:18.349 --> 17:20.109
the pouring rain
in which I knelt before the Li Residence

17:20.109 --> 17:21.270
with my brother,

17:23.030 --> 17:24.560
the tears my mother shedded

17:25.160 --> 17:28.490
in front of my father's memorial tablet
without us knowing,

17:28.880 --> 17:30.510
and my grandfather's hands,

17:31.110 --> 17:33.240
stained dark by years of working with ink—

17:33.240 --> 17:35.300
yet they could never touch ink again.

17:37.350 --> 17:40.210
I hate to get involved
in the family power struggle.

17:41.750 --> 17:43.070
I also hate to be a pawn

17:43.440 --> 17:45.110
in the Tribute Ink battle.

17:45.880 --> 17:49.080
I want to be away from those nightmares
as far as possible.

17:51.750 --> 17:53.310
Do you know why I haven't

17:53.550 --> 17:55.750
brought up the Tribute Ink today at all?

17:57.960 --> 17:59.310
Because what I value...

18:00.550 --> 18:01.440
is you,

18:01.720 --> 18:02.720
Zhen.

18:03.880 --> 18:08.010
This has nothing to do with you attending
the Tribute Ink selection or not.

18:09.860 --> 18:12.160
Plus, as I'm looking at
this pinewood again today,

18:12.160 --> 18:13.560
I'm feeling more assured

18:13.880 --> 18:15.880
that even without
the authority over the Tribute Ink,

18:15.880 --> 18:17.030
you, Li Zhen,

18:17.640 --> 18:19.830
will definitely become Ming's

18:19.830 --> 18:21.110
best ink maker one day.

18:24.030 --> 18:24.880
Ming's

18:25.590 --> 18:26.830
best ink maker?

18:29.790 --> 18:30.550
I aspire

18:30.550 --> 18:33.440
to become a much greater ink maker

18:33.440 --> 18:34.480
than my grandfather.

18:34.480 --> 18:36.160
I want everyone in Huizhou—

18:36.200 --> 18:36.750
no—

18:36.830 --> 18:39.030
everyone in Ming

18:39.240 --> 18:41.350
to know my name, Li Zhen.

18:41.590 --> 18:42.720
I believe you.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.440
Your words

18:46.160 --> 18:48.020
have reminded me of an old friend.

18:50.550 --> 18:52.480
I guess it must be...

18:53.000 --> 18:53.960
that

18:54.680 --> 18:56.200
cowardly little boy, right?

18:56.200 --> 18:57.930
Don't say that about my friend.

18:58.350 --> 18:59.110
Fine, sure.

19:00.310 --> 19:01.830
If he were still alive,

19:02.310 --> 19:03.240
he would be

19:03.640 --> 19:04.830
about your age now.

19:07.400 --> 19:09.600
But he surely wouldn't be as tall as you.

19:09.790 --> 19:12.390
Because you said he was only this big
last time.

19:17.640 --> 19:18.400
Qi Jiu,

19:19.270 --> 19:20.730
I never thought you'd come

19:21.750 --> 19:23.880
for something other than to persuade me.

19:23.880 --> 19:24.640
You are the first one

19:24.640 --> 19:27.960
who isn't trying to talk me into attending
the Tribute Ink selection.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.000
But I'm aware

19:29.110 --> 19:30.400
that you came to Huizhou this time

19:30.400 --> 19:31.930
exactly for the selection.

19:32.400 --> 19:34.660
My decision might put you in a tough spot.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.960
If you want to withdraw your investment
in the New Li Ink Workshop,

19:37.960 --> 19:39.240
I'll have no complaints.

19:39.240 --> 19:40.030
No, no.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.960
I've always trusted my own judgment.

19:43.030 --> 19:43.920
It's just

19:44.070 --> 19:46.070
that I trust you even more right now.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.820
So I definitely won't withdraw
my investment

19:47.820 --> 19:49.280
in the New Li Ink Workshop.

19:49.680 --> 19:50.640
Zhen,

19:51.200 --> 19:53.160
just do whatever you want.

20:00.720 --> 20:01.440
Then...

20:03.000 --> 20:04.590
If the New Li Ink Workshop performs

20:04.590 --> 20:06.390
better and better in the future,

20:06.480 --> 20:09.410
I'll be glad to give you
an extra share of the benefits

20:09.550 --> 20:11.610
as a reward for your trust in me today.

20:12.550 --> 20:13.350
Good.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.310
I'll be waiting to receive

20:15.310 --> 20:16.790
dividends from you then, Zhen.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.450
No problem.

20:17.960 --> 20:18.880
This pinewood

20:19.000 --> 20:20.590
is the witness to our pact.

20:21.160 --> 20:21.680
Sure.

20:32.270 --> 20:32.790
Come on,

20:32.790 --> 20:33.550
dear guests,

20:33.550 --> 20:34.550
this way, please.

20:39.110 --> 20:41.160
Ronghua, I hope
this letter finds you well.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.480
Autumn has just arrived.

20:42.480 --> 20:43.940
How are you in the capital?

20:44.350 --> 20:46.270
Everything is as usual in Huizhou.

20:46.270 --> 20:49.440
The New Li Ink Workshop has started off
on the right track.

20:49.440 --> 20:51.680
An adequate number of ink-makers
and workers have been hired.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.440
This time,

20:52.790 --> 20:55.000
I've even managed to recruit
a female worker.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.640
The business is picking up.

20:57.270 --> 20:58.270
Ronghua, will you

20:58.270 --> 21:01.160
return to Huizhou
for this year's Mid-Autumn Festival?

21:01.160 --> 21:02.310
If you will,

21:02.640 --> 21:04.440
we must have a proper gathering.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.110
Ronghua.

21:12.270 --> 21:12.920
Mother.

21:24.240 --> 21:24.920
Be seated.

21:29.640 --> 21:31.880
I'm so sorry that Qi unluckily

21:32.550 --> 21:34.480
passed away due to a sudden illness

21:34.630 --> 21:37.030
before he could marry you.

21:37.960 --> 21:40.640
Today, I'm here to ask you

21:41.640 --> 21:43.720
about your plans for the future.

21:46.070 --> 21:46.790
Mother,

21:47.240 --> 21:50.240
although I couldn't become
your daughter-in-law for real,

21:50.240 --> 21:52.100
you treat me as your own, and saved

21:52.160 --> 21:54.130
the Tian family from grave trouble.

21:54.130 --> 21:55.860
For that, I'm deeply grateful.

21:59.310 --> 22:00.770
Mother, if you don't mind,

22:00.920 --> 22:03.520
I'd love to be
a loyal companion to you forever,

22:03.590 --> 22:05.000
paying respects morning and evening,

22:05.000 --> 22:06.510
so as to repay your great kindness
by fulfilling filial duties

22:06.510 --> 22:08.110
in the Young Master's stead.

22:08.510 --> 22:09.440
Get up.

22:13.110 --> 22:13.790
Sit down.

22:18.000 --> 22:18.790
Ronghua,

22:19.310 --> 22:22.350
you may call me Aunt from now on.

22:24.040 --> 22:26.490
Yes, Aunt Wan.

22:26.960 --> 22:28.480
I will keep that in mind.

22:33.070 --> 22:35.110
Given your young age,

22:35.270 --> 22:38.270
staying in the manor all day
will definitely bore you.

22:38.310 --> 22:39.170
How about this?

22:39.200 --> 22:40.110
In a few days,

22:40.590 --> 22:42.920
I will take you to meet Sage Qing He.

22:43.090 --> 22:45.020
He is now a noble royal preceptor.

22:45.480 --> 22:46.920
If he agrees to let you stick around,

22:46.920 --> 22:48.850
you'll get to see more of the world.

22:52.060 --> 22:52.740
There you are, Hua'er.

22:52.740 --> 22:53.500
Hua'er.

22:55.430 --> 22:56.280
Zhen!

22:56.310 --> 22:56.830
Hua'er.

22:56.830 --> 22:57.920
The New Li Ink Workshop's business

22:57.920 --> 22:59.200
is really booming now.

22:59.200 --> 23:00.200
Come sit down.

23:00.510 --> 23:01.440
Here, be seated.

23:02.240 --> 23:02.830
Zhen,

23:03.270 --> 23:04.930
let me tell you some good news.

23:06.440 --> 23:07.550
Starting today,

23:07.640 --> 23:10.040
I will be working
in the New Li Ink Workshop.

23:10.310 --> 23:10.830
Really?

23:10.920 --> 23:11.200
Really.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.550
Has the Seventh Grandmother agreed?

23:12.550 --> 23:13.960
Yes. Not only that,

23:14.030 --> 23:16.290
she also asked me to bring you something.

23:17.440 --> 23:19.880
She said the freshly fermented
stinky mandarin fish inside

23:19.880 --> 23:21.790
is your favorite, Zhen.

23:21.790 --> 23:23.990
So she had me deliver it to you in person.

23:24.160 --> 23:26.000
How considerate
of the Seventh Grandmother.

23:26.000 --> 23:28.480
But why are there pine branches on top?

23:29.480 --> 23:32.960
The Seventh Grandmother said
this is a Huizhou tradition.

23:33.070 --> 23:34.640
It symbolizes

23:34.830 --> 23:37.000
everlasting prosperity

23:37.030 --> 23:38.200
and good luck.

23:38.990 --> 23:41.830
So, I plucked some from the pine yard.

23:41.830 --> 23:43.430
That was why I came a bit late.

23:45.590 --> 23:46.350
Anything wrong?

23:46.350 --> 23:47.240
What's wrong?

23:49.510 --> 23:50.640
It's the fish head.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.590
Just the fish head.

23:53.270 --> 23:55.480
Zhen, you gave me such a fright.

23:55.680 --> 23:56.720
I have so much more to say,

23:56.720 --> 23:58.200
yet I can't speak it out now.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.590
Alright.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.960
My bad, Hua'er.

24:01.070 --> 24:02.720
Go on. Go on with your talk.

24:05.030 --> 24:06.790
Next, there's a message

24:06.790 --> 24:08.520
from the Seventh Grandmother.

24:13.510 --> 24:14.840
She said, "Little Zhen,

24:15.640 --> 24:19.300
it's up to the Li family to decide
about the Tribute Ink selection.

24:19.890 --> 24:21.440
After all, this is an obstacle

24:21.440 --> 24:23.840
that the Li family must tackle
on their own.

24:23.920 --> 24:26.000
It is in no way related to you.

24:26.590 --> 24:28.880
Should they win or lose,

24:29.160 --> 24:30.640
it won't concern you.

24:31.110 --> 24:32.270
Little Zhen,

24:32.310 --> 24:35.350
just try your best
to run the New Li Ink Workshop.

24:36.790 --> 24:39.680
Also, congratulations
on creating Fu Jin Ink

24:40.070 --> 24:42.160
and helping others out of hot water.

24:42.310 --> 24:46.110
That makes you truly worthy of
being called upright and honorable."

24:49.400 --> 24:51.200
I didn't say a single word wrong.

25:00.670 --> 25:02.930
Many thanks to the Seventh Grandmother.

25:13.350 --> 25:14.110
Hua'er,

25:15.240 --> 25:16.510
where did you say

25:16.920 --> 25:18.640
you got these pine branches?

25:19.160 --> 25:20.550
The Li family's pine yard.

25:20.550 --> 25:21.480
Anything wrong?

25:22.520 --> 25:24.640
Come with me to the Li family's pine yard.

25:24.640 --> 25:25.920
What for?

25:28.750 --> 25:29.680
Mr. Zhao!

25:30.480 --> 25:32.240
Bring a message to the Sixth Master
at Li Ink.

25:32.240 --> 25:33.000
Tell him...

25:33.820 --> 25:36.880
there might be a problem
with the Li family's pine yard.

25:47.440 --> 25:48.750
Hua'er, hurry.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.310
This way, Hua'er.

26:04.030 --> 26:04.830
Do be careful.

26:20.680 --> 26:21.880
As I speculated, it is

26:22.750 --> 26:24.090
an outbreak of pine wilt disease.

26:24.090 --> 26:25.730
The ink workshop has the pine yard

26:25.730 --> 26:27.660
inspected once every half a month.

26:28.160 --> 26:30.350
How did they fail to detect
this situation?

26:30.350 --> 26:32.400
Pine wilt disease spreads very quickly.

26:32.400 --> 26:34.030
It tends to occur in obscure locations.

26:34.030 --> 26:35.420
Unless one happens to cut off

26:35.420 --> 26:37.160
a pine tree's trunk in the early stages,

26:37.160 --> 26:38.270
the condition can't be noticed.

26:38.270 --> 26:39.310
However, now,

26:39.830 --> 26:41.400
the illness has reached the top branches

26:41.400 --> 26:43.110
and entered an incurable phase.

26:43.110 --> 26:45.310
W-What should we do then?

26:45.990 --> 26:47.990
Li Ink is known for its pine soot ink.

26:48.680 --> 26:50.440
Now, with this outbreak
of pine wilt disease,

26:50.440 --> 26:52.510
the production will inevitably decrease.

26:52.510 --> 26:55.240
It'll also likely to affect
Li Ink's performance

26:55.480 --> 26:57.140
in the Tribute Ink selection.

26:57.960 --> 26:58.750
Hua'er!

27:00.070 --> 27:01.200
Sixth Grandfather!

27:01.880 --> 27:02.750
Sixth Grandfather.

27:02.750 --> 27:03.440
Hua'er.

27:05.830 --> 27:06.550
Zhen,

27:07.070 --> 27:08.330
how are the pine trees?

27:10.900 --> 27:11.900
Give me the knife!

27:13.680 --> 27:14.880
-Sixth Grandfather!
-Sixth Grandfather!

27:14.880 --> 27:15.830
No need to examine those.

27:15.830 --> 27:17.630
I've just had a check over there!

27:18.920 --> 27:19.480
Hold it.

27:34.310 --> 27:36.510
Heaven has turned against us Li family.

27:38.310 --> 27:41.110
Heaven has turned against us Li family!

27:55.520 --> 27:56.270
Old Madam,

27:56.510 --> 27:57.570
Eldest Young Lady.

28:04.640 --> 28:05.480
Sixth Uncle.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.200
It's true.

28:16.930 --> 28:18.890
It's truly the pine wilt disease.

28:23.920 --> 28:24.880
Jinhe,

28:26.110 --> 28:27.370
now, will it be too late

28:27.960 --> 28:31.400
to preserve the woods
by cutting down the infected trees?

28:34.510 --> 28:35.710
If we had taken action

28:36.400 --> 28:37.350
half a month earlier,

28:37.350 --> 28:39.550
a patch of the woods might be protected.

28:39.920 --> 28:42.720
But now, the disease
is spreading to every corner.

28:42.920 --> 28:46.380
We can do nothing but wait for the trees
to recover on their own.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.900
It will take at least three to five years.

28:49.160 --> 28:51.290
The number could go up to as high as ten.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.310
Manager Shao,

28:58.030 --> 28:59.830
how much pine wood is left

29:00.350 --> 29:02.350
in the ink workshop now?

29:02.750 --> 29:04.720
Can it help us finish

29:05.240 --> 29:06.640
all the existing orders?

29:08.550 --> 29:10.010
Old Madam, we have exactly

29:10.030 --> 29:11.690
500 cubic meters of pine wood.

29:12.200 --> 29:13.510
If we use it sparingly,

29:14.160 --> 29:16.360
it might last us for another two months.

29:23.590 --> 29:25.110
Right now,

29:25.970 --> 29:27.570
we have no choice but to pause

29:27.640 --> 29:29.170
the development of new ink.

29:30.640 --> 29:32.640
Pool all the pine wood together

29:32.640 --> 29:34.750
to quickly produce ordered ink.

29:35.030 --> 29:36.920
Send someone out of town

29:37.110 --> 29:38.920
to look for new pine wood

29:38.920 --> 29:41.030
to fill the future shortage.

29:41.240 --> 29:42.100
Mother, are you

29:42.270 --> 29:45.000
giving up
on the upcoming Tribute Ink selection?

29:46.400 --> 29:47.240
Rujun,

29:48.750 --> 29:50.210
the Li family has long been

29:50.640 --> 29:51.880
without a foothold.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.700
The Tribute Ink selection

29:56.720 --> 29:59.510
is our only chance to turn things around.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.240
Yes, Mother.

30:06.510 --> 30:07.480
Jinhe,

30:09.030 --> 30:11.830
the Tribute Ink selection is held
every few years.

30:11.960 --> 30:13.510
Even if we bail on it this time,

30:13.510 --> 30:15.440
we can still go for it another time.

30:16.110 --> 30:19.550
However, if we stop
the supply of pine soot ink,

30:20.070 --> 30:21.920
we'll suffer a loss

30:23.030 --> 30:24.440
of ink buyers.

30:25.240 --> 30:28.640
They will go find another supplier.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.400
When that happens,

30:30.510 --> 30:33.200
the Li family
will really become destitute!

30:33.750 --> 30:35.210
Ever since ancient times,

30:35.720 --> 30:37.400
survival has always been

30:37.750 --> 30:39.480
prioritized over prosperity.

30:39.960 --> 30:41.360
The Li family's business

30:42.160 --> 30:43.420
has always centered on

30:43.880 --> 30:46.550
pine soot ink for large orders.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.310
If...

30:49.590 --> 30:52.190
the foundation of our family business
is gone,

30:52.830 --> 30:56.200
what else will be left for us?

30:58.520 --> 31:00.730
[Ink Recipe]

31:14.750 --> 31:16.720
Jingdong, it's time to eat.

31:16.750 --> 31:18.550
Take it away. I'm not hungry.

31:20.030 --> 31:21.590
Grab a few bites at least.

31:21.590 --> 31:23.320
I'm telling you to take it away.

31:28.880 --> 31:29.510
Father.

31:48.070 --> 31:48.790
Jingdong,

31:49.550 --> 31:51.030
eat some of it at least.

31:52.680 --> 31:55.270
Don't let Ying's good intentions
go to waste.

31:55.680 --> 31:56.350
Father,

31:57.000 --> 31:59.070
the Tribute Ink selection will begin soon.

31:59.070 --> 32:00.480
I'm running out of time.

32:05.110 --> 32:08.040
We won't attend
the upcoming Tribute Ink selection.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.000
Father,

32:15.160 --> 32:16.690
what are you talking about?

32:16.880 --> 32:19.400
I'm saying that we're quitting
the Tribute Ink selection.

32:19.400 --> 32:20.510
Why?

32:20.980 --> 32:23.000
There's an outbreak of pine wilt disease
in the pine yard.

32:23.000 --> 32:23.590
Father,

32:25.160 --> 32:26.620
even with that condition,

32:26.790 --> 32:28.990
we can still go out to look for pine wood.

32:30.310 --> 32:32.310
Why do we have to quit the selection?

32:32.590 --> 32:34.480
Why must we give up, Father?

32:35.830 --> 32:36.510
Father.

32:41.750 --> 32:42.480
Father!

32:43.550 --> 32:44.830
We must not bail on it.

32:46.590 --> 32:47.310
Father,

32:49.110 --> 32:51.200
do you know how much effort I've put

32:52.200 --> 32:54.270
into this selection?

32:56.480 --> 32:58.960
We can't just give up, Father.

32:59.110 --> 33:00.070
Listen to me...

33:00.070 --> 33:01.790
No, you listen to me, Father.

33:02.880 --> 33:05.000
Do you remember what you told me

33:05.000 --> 33:06.720
when I was a child?

33:08.160 --> 33:09.640
You said that men should

33:10.270 --> 33:11.440
always fight

33:12.030 --> 33:13.240
and strive,

33:14.510 --> 33:16.510
and that quitting is not an option.

33:16.960 --> 33:18.160
Do you remember?

33:18.440 --> 33:21.310
You said that the Eighth Branch

33:21.550 --> 33:23.750
was not superior to us the Sixth Branch.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.510
So I took your words.

33:26.200 --> 33:27.400
I was more

33:27.680 --> 33:29.140
hardworking and diligent

33:29.270 --> 33:30.550
than Jingfu and Jingqi

33:30.550 --> 33:32.590
when I was little.

33:32.680 --> 33:34.400
I did it so that one day

33:34.400 --> 33:36.270
everyone would come to realize

33:36.880 --> 33:37.590
that I,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.350
your son Li Jingdong, am

33:39.400 --> 33:40.960
better than them both!

33:40.960 --> 33:42.070
Just hear me out...

33:42.070 --> 33:42.830
Father!

33:44.480 --> 33:46.540
The Eighth Branch has been expelled.

33:46.640 --> 33:49.070
Isn't this the best time
for us the Sixth Branch

33:49.070 --> 33:50.510
to prove ourselves?

33:52.440 --> 33:55.720
I will have everyone know

33:56.110 --> 33:58.240
that I, Li Jingdong, am

33:58.270 --> 34:00.400
the backbone of this family!

34:01.070 --> 34:03.960
I am better than that little girl Li Zhen!

34:04.920 --> 34:07.180
The Li family does have a competent heir.

34:07.880 --> 34:08.480
Father,

34:09.880 --> 34:11.210
I don't care what you do.

34:11.800 --> 34:12.960
But I will by no means

34:14.000 --> 34:15.800
back down!

35:08.810 --> 35:13.140
[Champion of Ink Making]

35:15.110 --> 35:17.170
My dear seventh and eighth brothers,

35:19.070 --> 35:20.870
I'm sorry to be a disappointment

35:23.920 --> 35:25.710
to you and the Li family.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.360
I'm sorry.

35:53.710 --> 35:55.710
Zhen, Zhen.

35:56.150 --> 35:57.840
Why are you back so late today?

35:59.110 --> 36:02.190
Mother, after much consideration
on the pine wilt disease,

36:02.190 --> 36:04.100
I think I should tell Grandpa about it.

36:04.100 --> 36:05.760
Anyway, Wuyuan isn't far away.

36:05.760 --> 36:08.510
I plan to go pick Grandpa up
early tomorrow morning.

36:08.510 --> 36:10.620
You're heading to Wuyuan tomorrow morning?

36:10.620 --> 36:11.210
Yes.

36:17.030 --> 36:17.920
Grandpa?

36:18.030 --> 36:18.760
Father?

36:18.880 --> 36:20.210
Why would you come back?

36:20.960 --> 36:22.430
I got a message from Rujun.

36:22.800 --> 36:24.840
The pine wilt disease outbreak
has to be handled at once.

36:24.840 --> 36:26.700
I'm going to the Li Residence now.

36:28.070 --> 36:29.710
B-Be careful then!

36:42.030 --> 36:43.030
Jinshui.

36:44.320 --> 36:45.190
Rujun.

36:46.890 --> 36:48.600
Jinshui, why are you back?

36:50.670 --> 36:52.360
Regarding the pine wilt disease,

36:52.360 --> 36:53.880
Jinhe, Rujun,

36:54.150 --> 36:55.360
what are your plans?

36:55.360 --> 36:57.150
This outbreak could be said

36:57.230 --> 36:59.150
as a lethal blow to Li Ink.

37:00.550 --> 37:02.030
Perhaps Li Ink will have to

37:02.840 --> 37:06.480
miss out
on the upcoming Tribute Ink selection.

37:09.710 --> 37:11.310
Due to the pine wilt disease,

37:12.480 --> 37:14.550
the best solution right now

37:15.000 --> 37:17.000
is to withdraw from this selection.

37:19.960 --> 37:21.620
Why, just because you said so?

37:22.110 --> 37:24.960
Who are you to offer any advice
to the Li family?

37:26.230 --> 37:27.190
Withdraw?

37:27.230 --> 37:28.440
How could you even

37:28.440 --> 37:30.240
bring yourself to suggest that?

37:30.840 --> 37:31.630
Aunt Rujun,

37:32.220 --> 37:36.430
outsiders can't share weal and woe
with Li Ink.

37:36.710 --> 37:39.420
You know better than I do
about what kind of situation

37:39.420 --> 37:41.320
the Li family has been reduced to today.

37:41.320 --> 37:43.760
If we give up
on this Tribute Ink selection,

37:43.880 --> 37:45.400
there will be no place

37:45.630 --> 37:48.150
for Li Ink in Huizhou anymore.

37:48.150 --> 37:49.480
Jingdong,

37:50.320 --> 37:52.190
I understand you're fully dedicated

37:52.190 --> 37:53.510
to Li Ink.

37:54.030 --> 37:55.550
But now, given the pine wilt disease

37:55.550 --> 37:56.230
and the importance of...

37:56.230 --> 37:58.710
Not many people know about
the current condition yet.

37:58.710 --> 38:00.630
We can even afford

38:01.360 --> 38:02.840
century-old pine wood.

38:02.840 --> 38:05.040
All we need to do is procure wood in time.

38:13.880 --> 38:15.610
Even if we try to hide the truth,

38:16.360 --> 38:18.090
how long can we keep it a secret?

38:18.710 --> 38:20.320
Once the news gets out,

38:20.880 --> 38:22.840
the price of pine wood will surely surge.

38:22.840 --> 38:26.190
Merchants will hoard it
for a higher price.

38:27.150 --> 38:29.150
If our delivery of goods is delayed,

38:29.510 --> 38:30.840
that will be a disaster.

38:30.840 --> 38:34.150
What disaster could be worse
than what happened years ago?

38:35.710 --> 38:36.510
Li Jinshui,

38:36.840 --> 38:38.590
to put it bluntly,

38:39.190 --> 38:40.000
you

38:40.230 --> 38:41.440
and the Eighth Branch

38:41.510 --> 38:43.440
are the root cause of all disasters!

38:43.440 --> 38:44.360
Jingdong!

38:46.960 --> 38:47.630
Aunt Rujun,

38:48.230 --> 38:52.030
I'm wholeheartedly fighting
for the best interests of Li Ink.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.510
However,

38:53.840 --> 38:57.400
you keep defending
this sinner of the Li family.

38:57.840 --> 38:58.510
Fine.

38:59.000 --> 39:01.030
Now that you all want to give up,

39:02.280 --> 39:04.790
I, Li Jingdong, will set up
my own business.

39:04.810 --> 39:06.150
Let's part ways

39:06.150 --> 39:08.410
so you won't be bothered with me anymore!

39:08.590 --> 39:09.510
You vile spawn!

39:10.540 --> 39:11.740
What did you just say?

39:11.960 --> 39:13.290
Say it again, I dare you!

39:27.590 --> 39:28.400
Jinhe...

39:32.400 --> 39:33.800
Jinshui, get up now.

39:34.480 --> 39:36.880
I'm not strong enough to help you up.
Get up.

39:44.360 --> 39:45.800
Rujun, Jinshui,

39:46.000 --> 39:46.510
come on.

39:48.360 --> 39:49.920
Take a look at this.

39:52.670 --> 39:55.730
Is this the map of pine trees
on Mount Huang?

39:56.360 --> 39:57.230
Yes, exactly.

39:58.400 --> 40:00.600
I got it from the Literary Association.

40:01.480 --> 40:02.590
Over these years,

40:03.280 --> 40:05.510
new pine woods have been discovered,

40:05.920 --> 40:08.180
in which the pine trees are old and solid.

40:08.730 --> 40:09.130
Look.

40:09.150 --> 40:09.880
Jinhe,

40:12.350 --> 40:14.080
you want to enter the mountain?

40:15.000 --> 40:17.360
No, I disagree.

40:19.160 --> 40:19.980
Listen,

40:20.480 --> 40:21.940
Jingdong is making a fuss.

40:22.010 --> 40:23.410
Are you joining him now?

40:41.800 --> 40:42.670
Rujun,

40:45.360 --> 40:47.330
Jingdong is a bit stubborn,

40:49.190 --> 40:50.920
but some of what he said is true.

40:53.630 --> 40:56.800
If we give up
on the upcoming Tribute Ink selection,

40:57.960 --> 40:59.840
there will probably be no place

41:00.590 --> 41:01.800
for Li Ink in Huizhou

41:02.320 --> 41:04.070
in the future.

41:06.110 --> 41:09.280
I just checked the ledgers
at the ink workshop.

41:10.070 --> 41:11.960
Ten years of heavy taxes have almost

41:11.960 --> 41:14.160
emptied Li Ink's century-old savings.

41:15.070 --> 41:17.190
Business is getting worse day by day.

41:17.820 --> 41:20.030
At this rate, even if we make it through

41:20.510 --> 41:22.510
this outbreak of pine wilt disease,

41:24.150 --> 41:25.320
who knows

41:26.550 --> 41:29.350
if we can make it
to the next Tribute Ink selection.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.110
Rujun,

41:39.630 --> 41:42.190
Li Ink might not have another chance.

41:43.760 --> 41:45.160
Please allow me to go find

41:45.440 --> 41:46.900
pine wood in the mountain.

41:49.920 --> 41:50.670
Rujun!

41:55.960 --> 41:57.840
Miss Li, we're getting off work.

41:58.550 --> 41:59.440
Nice work today.

41:59.440 --> 42:00.280
Get some rest then.

42:00.280 --> 42:00.760
Sure.

42:09.630 --> 42:10.550
We're closed for today.

42:10.550 --> 42:11.410
Please come...

42:11.590 --> 42:14.440
Young Lady, are you even going to
turn me away?

42:15.440 --> 42:16.570
Sixth Grandfather,

42:17.110 --> 42:18.310
what brings you here?

42:18.960 --> 42:19.880
Good for you.

42:21.410 --> 42:24.050
You've really started
your own ink workshop.

42:24.510 --> 42:25.710
It must be no easy job.

42:27.760 --> 42:30.090
Now that you're here, Sixth Grandfather,

42:30.400 --> 42:32.320
please sit down for a cup of tea.

42:35.190 --> 42:36.630
Today, I came here...

42:37.960 --> 42:40.070
to ask you a favor.

42:41.150 --> 42:42.150
Take a seat first.

42:42.190 --> 42:42.920
Sure.

42:44.840 --> 42:46.320
Speak your mind then.

42:48.110 --> 42:49.920
There's an outbreak of pine wilt disease,

42:49.920 --> 42:52.230
yet Li Ink needs pine wood
for the Tribute Ink selection.

42:52.230 --> 42:53.670
In a few days,

42:54.190 --> 42:56.190
I'll go to Mount Huang for pine wood.

42:58.510 --> 43:02.280
I'd like you to come back
and manage the Li Ink workshop.
